graph TD
    Student[学生]
    Teacher[教师]
    Admin[管理员]
    Support[技术支持]

    subgraph 系统边界
        AuthService[(认证服务)]
        CourseDB[(课程数据库)]
        AssignmentDB[(作业与提交库)]
        ResourceStore[(对象存储)]
        Notification[(通知服务)]
        Analytics[(分析与指标引擎)]
        Audit[(审计日志 ES)]
        Config[(配置中心)]
    end

    Student -->|登录凭证| AuthService
    Teacher -->|登录凭证| AuthService
    Admin -->|登录凭证| AuthService
    AuthService -->|JWT & 角色| Student
    AuthService -->|JWT & 角色| Teacher
    AuthService -->|JWT & 角色| Admin

    Teacher -->|创建课程/公告| CourseDB
    Admin -->|审批课程/成员| CourseDB
    Teacher -->|上传资源元数据| CourseDB
    Teacher -->|文件上传| ResourceStore
    Student -->|下载资源| ResourceStore

    Student -->|作业提交| AssignmentDB
    AssignmentDB -->|附件引用| ResourceStore
    Teacher -->|批阅评分| AssignmentDB
    AssignmentDB -->|批阅结果| Student
    AssignmentDB -->|状态变更事件| Notification
    Notification -->|站内信/邮件/企业微信| Student
    Notification -->|教学提醒| Teacher

    AssignmentDB -->|提交数据| Analytics
    CourseDB -->|课程结构/成员| Analytics
    ResourceStore -->|访问日志| Analytics
    Analytics -->|仪表盘| Teacher
    Analytics -->|报表导出| Admin

    AuthService -->|安全事件| Audit
    AssignmentDB -->|操作轨迹| Audit
    Support -->|查看告警| Notification
    Support -->|审计查询| Audit

    Config --> AuthService
    Config --> Notification
    Config --> Analytics
